{
 "about": "Where RPG Hunt looks for deals and for new sellers. scraper/discover.py reads them every day. feeds: RSS/Atom; purpose 'deals' = sale roundups (also used to spot deals our readers missed), purpose 'sellers' = English RPG news and blogs whose outbound links may be shops or publishers we do not know yet. fetch_articles: true = open roundup posts only, 'all' = open every recent post (the RSS holds only a summary). directories: lists of RPG sellers (English Wikipedia categories; each article's infobox website). Wikidata is not used: its robots.txt disallows bots on the query service and API. No daily caps: safety_max_probes_per_day and max_article_fetches_per_feed are runaway guards only, reported when hit.",
 "max_age_days": 14,
 "max_article_fetches_per_feed": 200,
